a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">印度AI初创公司Sarvam AI开启3.5亿美元融资，亚马逊与英伟达参投</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，全面采用Apache 2.0协议</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持本地与云端无缝切换</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义实验室发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及创作工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c3b901abb4903f434ab5254da4c224f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义实验室正式发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及配套创作工具，旨在解决AI视频创作中内容生成不专业及修改困难的痛点。该模型支持文本、图像、视频和音频全模态输入，具备极高的画面结构、剧情走向及局部细节控制能力。Wan2.7-Video的核心优势在于强大的编辑功能，用户可通过指令实现视频元素精准调整，包括删除路人、替换物体、转换背景环境及一键风格切换。在剧情创作方面，用户无需重新拍摄，即可通过指令修改角色台词、动作及镜头角度。此外，该工具还支持创意快速复刻、剧情延续创作及精准的时序控制，确保视频内容的无缝衔接与流畅性。这一工具的推出，显著提升了创作者对视频内容的编辑自由度与灵活性，为AI视频生产流程提供了更高效的解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源DiNA架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bef7ae15e1dd4bcc97202363107ad19a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团技术团队于4月3日正式发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next，并同步开源模型及dNaViT分词器。该模型摒弃了“语言基座+插件”的拼凑架构，采用自研DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构，将图像、语音与文本统一转化为同源离散Token，实现了多模态建模的底层统一。在技术细节上，dNaViT视觉分词器通过8层残差向量量化，实现高达28倍的像素空间压缩，同时保留了OCR及财报解析等任务的关键细节。性能表现方面，LongCat-Next在OmniDocBench密集文本场景测试中超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，在MathVista视觉推理测试中达到83.1分，且在保持C-Eval 86.80语言能力的同时，支持低延迟并行文本语音生成及语音克隆。该模型的发布证明了物理信息可被离散化并像语言一样建模，为开发</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">印度AI初创公司Sarvam AI开启3.5亿美元融资，亚马逊与英伟达参投</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/76c7ee7ad1ad22d40255d6693e86155c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">印度AI初创公司Sarvam AI于4月3日正式开启新一轮融资，计划筹集3亿至3.5亿美元，投后估值预计达15亿至15.5亿美元，最快有望在一周内完成。本轮融资由Bessemer Venture Partners领投，亚马逊、英伟达及沙特阿美旗下Prosperity7 Ventures均有意参与。成立于2023年的Sarvam AI专注于印度本土化建模，今年2月已发布参数分别为300亿和1050亿的大语言模型，重点支持22种印度语言及语音交互。目前，该公司正研发具备Agentic能力的AI系统，旨在赋能企业自动化场景。此次融资不仅是资本对印度AI潜力的认可，也标志着亚马逊与英伟达通过布局本土化AI生态，进一步抢占南亚市场基座。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，全面采用Apache 2.0协议</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1d22e11eec6c71e104a1c8a05dcf79c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月3日，Google DeepMind正式发布新一代开源模型系列Gemma 4，并全面转向Apache 2.0许可证，支持开发者自由商用与二次开发。该系列涵盖四款模型：旗舰版31B Dense支持256K上下文，单张H100即可运行；26B A4B MoE采用混合专家架构，兼顾推理速度与质量；E4B与E2B专为端侧优化，内存占用最低可至1.5GB。性能方面，Gemma 4在AIME 2026数学测试中得分达89.2%，Codeforces ELO评分提升至2150。全系内置可开关的“思考模式”，支持函数调用、结构化JSON输出及原生Agent开发。此外，全版本支持图像与视频输入，小模型版本额外集成音频编码器。此次发布标志着谷歌通过极致的端侧工程化与更彻底的开源协议，重塑开源AI赛道竞争力，显著降低了高性能模型</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持本地与云端无缝切换</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/406b78eec862fc61ca34a2776c0327d4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor团队正式发布Cursor 3版本，标志着软件开发模式从“人机协作”向“智能体自主工作”转型。新版本核心创新在于“智能体统一工作区”，允许开发者在侧边栏集中管理多个智能体，并支持从移动端、Web、桌面及Slack等多终端启动。Cursor 3实现了本地与云端智能体的无缝切换，确保长时间任务在离线状态下仍可运行。此外，云端智能体新增工作成果演示与截图功能，提升项目进展可视化程度。在代码审查方面，新版本引入了更简洁的差异视图UI，优化了变更编辑与团队协作效率。Cursor 3继续保持对语言服务器协议（LSP）、内置浏览器及各类插件的完整支持。用户现可通过升级Cursor并输入Cmd+Shift+P调出Agents Window体验新界面。官方表示，该版本旨在为构建更自主的智能体及实现代码库自我驱动奠定基础</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
